sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCH as Python Scheduler
    participant NC as News Intelligence Service
    participant CFG as Approved Source Registry
    participant RSS as RSS Adapter
    participant WEB as Safe HTML Fetcher
    participant EXT as External Source
    participant EXTCT as Content Extractor
    participant TAG as LLM Tagger
    participant SENT as SentimentAnalyzer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/Object Storage
    participant STR as StrategyRuntime

    SCH->>NC: collect_all(since checkpoint)
    NC->>CFG: active allowlisted sources
    CFG-->>NC: RSS feeds + article origin rules

    alt RSS source
        NC->>RSS: collect metadata
        RSS->>EXT: GET RSS with timeout/size limit
        EXT-->>RSS: RSS XML
        RSS-->>NC: title, URL, summary, published_at
    else approved article URL
        NC->>WEB: fetch URL
        WEB->>WEB: HTTPS + DNS/IP + redirect + size guards
        WEB->>EXT: GET article
        EXT-->>WEB: HTML
        WEB->>EXTCT: sanitize + readability extraction
        EXTCT-->>NC: canonical text + content_hash
    end

    NC->>DB: UPSERT NewsDocument by url_hash/content_hash<br/>store raw_html_uri optionally
    NC->>TAG: structured tag request<br/>coin/entity/topic/event + model/prompt version
    TAG-->>NC: validated tags + confidence + evidence spans
    NC->>DB: UPSERT NewsTags(document,tagger_model,prompt_version)

    NC->>SENT: classify canonical text
    alt model available and output valid
        SENT-->>NC: label + score + model_version
        NC->>DB: UPSERT SentimentResult by document/model/version
    else model unavailable
        NC->>DB: record analysis_attempt failed + alert metadata
        Note over NC,DB: Không tạo sentiment giả NEUTRAL.<br/>Document và tags vẫn tái sử dụng được.
    end

    STR->>DB: read versioned SentimentSnapshot by coin/window/as_of
    DB-->>STR: aggregate + item hashes + model versions

    Note over TAG,DB: LLM tagging chỉ chạy lại khi content hash,<br/>model hoặc prompt version thay đổi. Tag đã lưu được tái sử dụng.
